The following directories contain code copied or adapted from the
AndroidLiquidGlass repository (Apache-2.0):

  backdrops/        - CanvasBackdrop.kt, CombinedBackdrop.kt, LayerBackdrop.kt
  effects/          - Blur.kt, Lens.kt, Vibrancy.kt (derived from ColorFilter.kt)
  components/       - LiquidButton.kt, LiquidBottomTabs.kt, LiquidBottomTab.kt,
                      LiquidSlider.kt, LiquidToggle.kt, InteractiveHighlight.kt,
                      DampedDragAnimation.kt, DragGestureInspector.kt,
                      UISensor.kt, BackHandler.kt
  templates/        - glass-bottom-sheet.kt (official tutorial implementation)
  utils/            - Coroutines.kt, Bitmap.kt, ProgressConverter.kt, SdfShader.kt

Additional components (LiquidDialog, ControlCenter, MagnifierGlass,
GlassPlayground, AdaptiveLuminanceGlass, ProgressiveBlur, LiquidBottomSheet,
ScrollGlassContainers, LockScreenGlass, basic-glass.kt, interactive-glass.kt,
glass-bottom-bar.kt) are original implementations by this project's authors,
derived from the patterns and API of the AndroidLiquidGlass catalog, and are
also released under the Apache License 2.0.

Documentation URLs referenced by this project:

  Official docs:  https://kyant.gitbook.io/backdrop
  GitHub:         https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass
